;==================================================
;デート帰りにファーストKISS（合意も付く）
;==================================================
;==================================================
;Optional: Determines if the standard description should be skipped.
;Return 0 if description and KOJO should be shown, 1 if description should be hidden and KOJO shown, 2 if description should be shown and KOJO hidden, and 3 if both description and KOJO should be hidden.
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_MESSAGECHECK_K30_1
SIF TCVAR:30:キスキャンセル
	RETURN 1
RETURN 0

@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_K30_1(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
;地の文
IF !TCVAR:30:キスキャンセル
	PRINTFORMW 「%K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%. I have something I need to tell you.」
	PRINTFORML 「...What are you bracing yourself for? Eh? You thought I was going to lecture you?」
	PRINTFORML 「Do you see me as a youkai that simply emits lectures 24 hours a day?」
	PRINTFORML 「When you die, you will be judged.」
	PRINTFORML 「Before that happens, I simply want to lighten your sins as much as I can.」
	PRINTFORMW 「And yet, you... Are you listening? In the first place, sins are... Hah!」
	PRINTFORMW 「...Ahem.」
	PRINTFORML 「...Well, you see, I've been told this by someone before.」
	PRINTFORMW 「As a judge of others, I must be impartial and remain unaffected by others.」
	PRINTFORML 「I must be someone who keeps a certain distance from others, and teach humans and youkai equally how to live a virtuous life.」
	PRINTFORMW 「Did you know someone who's able to close that distance has recently come here to Gensokyo?」
	PRINTFORML 「A strange person who intentionally builds a relationship with a Yama that's closed herself off from others.」
	PRINTFORML 「%K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%, I hope we can continue to build that relationship.」
	PRINTFORML 「And finally... A small gift as proof of my affection.」
	PRINTFORMW 「I hope you will accept it.」
	PRINTFORMW ...Chuu.
	SETBIT CFLAG:30:1910, 6
	SIF CFLAG:1801 == 1
		CFLAG:1602 = 4
ELSEIF FIRSTTIME("キスキャンセル")
	PRINTFORMDL ...As you walk back with Eiki from your date, she suddenly stops.
	PRINTFORMDL She mumbles quietly as if she's unconsciously asking you...
	PRINTFORMW 
	PRINTFORML 「You're quite the curiosity, willingly accompanying a Yama...」
	PRINTFORML 「Are you spending time with me just for the novelty of it? Is it just whimsy?」
	PRINTFORMW 「Or maybe, just maybe...」
	PRINTFORML （...No, you already have someone else in your heart.）
	PRINTFORML （And there's no additional room for me there.）
	PRINTFORMDW Eiki's voice trails off midway, her words lost to the wind.
ENDIF
RETURN 1

