				PRINTFORMDW Eiki embraces your arm and presses her chest up against it.
				PRINTFORMW 「%K30_C_NAME(MASTER)% prefers cute ones to floppy, uselessly large ones.」
			ENDIF
			SIF TALENT:(ARG:1):恋慕
				PRINTFORMDW ...For a while, you experience what it's like to be the target of rivalry while sweating bullets...
		ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕
			IF ARG:1 == 76 && !TALENT:76:恋人
				PRINTFORMDL Having noticed the two of you, Eiki calls out to Komachi...
				PRINTFORMW 「You're an intelligent individual, so I'm sure you've already realized my feelings...」
				PRINTFORML 「However, as a Yama, I intend to be fair and just in all of my actions.」
				PRINTFORMW 「So don't worry, Komachi. We will be on equal footing in this match.」
				IF TALENT:76:恋慕
					PRINTFORML 
					PRINTFORMW 「And %K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%, I have a question for you...」
