					PRINTFORMDL You're taken aback by the revealing shoulderless T-shirt and gaudy, vividly colored skirt.
					PRINTFORMDW But you'd recognize that hat anywhere... It's Eiki.
					PRINTFORMDW You wonder what a Yama is doing wearing that kind of getup...
					IF TALENT:機嫌 > -1
						PRINTFORMDW Noticing you, Eiki begins to explain with a resigned look in her eyes.
