						DATAFORM 「...It's no use trying to hide anything. I can see everything within this mirror...」
						DATAFORM 「...Unfortunately, I cannot call this a virtuous life. Rather...」
						DATAFORM 「...Unbelievable. Even now, do you not understand...」
						DATAFORM 「...Others have done the same? Even so, you are responsible for your own actions...」
					ENDDATA
					PRINTFORMDL Eiki is lecturing the newly dead with \@ TALENT:機嫌 == -1 ? a bit of anger in her expression. # a hollow expression. \@
				ELSE
					IF TALENT:機嫌 > -1
						SELECTCASE RAND:3
							CASE 0
								PRINTFORMDL Today is "casual Friday" at the Ministry of Right and Wrong.
								PRINTFORML 「%K30_GREETING_EIKI()%, %K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%...」
								PRINTFORMDW Her attire might be casual, but her mental state seems rather troubled.
							CASE 1
								PRINTFORMDL It's Friday, so Eiki is wearing that T-shirt again.
								PRINTFORML 「Ah... %K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%... %K30_GREETING_EIKI()%...」
								PRINTFORML 「Please don't... look this way too much...」
							CASE 2
								PRINTFORMDL Seeing Eiki staring aimlessly into space, you decide to call out to her first.
								PRINTFORMW 「Hyah?!!」
								PRINTFORML 「...Ah, um... I'm sorry...」
								PRINTFORMW 「Ah, no, what I meant was... %K30_GREETING_EIKI()%...」
						ENDSELECT
					ELSE
						PRINTFORMDL Today is "casual Friday" at the Ministry of Right and Wrong.
						PRINTFORML 「......」
						IF RAND:2 == 1
							PRINTFORMDL ...A dangerous aura screaming "Don't talk to me" is swirling viciously around Eiki.
						ELSE
							PRINTFORMDL ...She looks even scarier than when she's lecturing someone.
						ENDIF
					ENDIF
				ENDIF
			ELSE
				IF STRCOUNT(CSTR:30:0, "変Ｔお披露目")
					PRINTFORMDL Eiki is wearing that T-shirt again, even though it's not Friday...
				ELSE
					PRINTFORMDL For some reason, Eiki is wearing \@ CFLAG:113:面識 ? the same clothes as Hecatia # some rather interesting casual clothes \@...
				ENDIF
				IF 仕事中チェック(30) && GET_JOBNAME(30) == "裁判"
					PRINTDATAL
						DATAFORM 「...It's no use trying to lie. Do you really think you can deceive a Yama? ...」
						DATAFORM 「...Yes, that's right. All of the sins you have accumulated during your life are...」
						DATAFORM 「...It's too late to repent, you know? I'm sorry to say, but you...」
						DATAFORM 「...It's no use trying to hide anything. I can see everything within this mirror...」
						DATAFORM 「...Unfortunately, I cannot call this a virtuous life. Rather...」
						DATAFORM 「...Unbelievable. Even now, do you not understand...」
						DATAFORM 「...Others have done the same? Even so, you are responsible for your own actions...」
					ENDDATA
					PRINTFORMDL Eiki is in the middle of lecturing the newly dead with \@ TALENT:機嫌 == -1 ? a bit of anger in her expression. # a hollow expression. \@
