            IF TALENT:機嫌 > -1
               PRINTFORMDW Noticing you, Eiki begins to explain with a resigned look in her eyes.
            ELSE
               PRINTFORMDW Noticing you, Eiki begins to explain with resentment in her eyes.
            ENDIF
				PRINTFORML 「Hecatia-sama came by this morning and handed me these clothes...」
				PRINTFORMW 「It appears that this has become quite trendy in Gensokyo recently.」
				PRINTFORML 「Everyone should be wearing the same clothes all day today...」
				IF TALENT:機嫌 > -1
					PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu, It's not just me anymore... Fufufu...」
					PRINTFORMDW She gives a hollow little laugh with eyes like a dead fish...
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「...You want to ask why I don't simply refuse? I would... if I could.」
					PRINTFORMDW It seems there are things even a Yama like Eiki cannot oppose...
				ENDIF
			ENDIF
		;同棲中=初期位置が一緒なのにおはよう口上を通してない場合
		ELSEIF CFLAG:MASTER:初期位置 == CFLAG:30:初期位置
			;おやすみ口上通している(=自室に帰っていた)時は生活リズムの違い
			IF CFLAG:1605 == 1
				CFLAG:1605 = 0
