						PRINTFORMDW If she services you this morning in that mood, you're worried she'll use her teeth...
				ELSE
					SELECTCASE RAND:3
						CASE 0
							PRINTFORML 「\@ TALENT:恋人 ? Morning # Good morning \@, %K30_C_NAME(MASTER)%.」
